# Welcome to the Workshop

Today we'll explore software performance optimization

===

# How to setup the quiz

**Start the quiz server**
```typescript
npm run start
```

**Expose your server to participants**
```typescript
npx http-server -p 3000 -a 0.0.0.0
```

